      "id": 1,
      "title": "HOME AUTOMATION ANDROID APPLICATION USING ARDUINO",
      "abstract": "The Home Automation Android Application Using Arduino is designed to provide convenient control of household appliances through an Android mobile application. The system uses Arduino to receive commands from the application and control connected devices. It aims to improve convenience, accessibility, and efficient appliance management at home.",
      "categoryId": 3,
      "adviser": "JOHN VIANNEY V. MANUEL",
      "members": "CALONGE, JEHOSAPHAT D.\nPIOQUINTO, JEREMY L.\nCARDENAS, ANGEL R.\nTAGARA, PHINKIE R.\nREYES, MATTHEW B.\nDAYRITH, MELANIE V.\nBRAVO, JERICHO P.",
      "features": "Research paradigm\nRapid Application Development Life Cycle\nOpening the Garage Door\nClosing the Garage Door\nSwitching the Light On\nSwitching the Light Off\nSwitching the Celling Fan On\nSwitching the Celling Fan Off\nSwitching the Household Appliance Off",
      "research": "Home Automation Android application Using Arduino",
      "schoolYear": "2023-2024",
